<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hughes said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hughes said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber upgraded Hughes Electronics Corp to attractive from neutral, a source at PaineWebber said.</p>
<p>-- Set target price range of $65 to $80 per share.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-3/8 to 56-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
